  <participating-org role="4" type="21">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stichting Wemos is a Dutch non-profit foundation based in Amsterdam that works to advance global health justice through policy advocacy and systems change. Founded in 1979 (and established as a foundation in 1981), Wemos collaborates with civil society organizations, researchers, healthcare professionals, and policymakers to address the structural causes of health inequities worldwide. Its work focuses on strengthening health systems, improving access to medicines, sustainable health financing, and ensuring an adequate health workforce. Wemos advocates for evidence-based policies grounded in the principle that health is a human right and aims to create lasting improvements in global public health through research, partnerships, and advocacy rather than direct service delivery.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stichting Wemos</narrative>
